---
kind: ObjectType
version: v1
definition:
  name: Members_1
  description: Health plan members (patients/subscribers) enrolled in insurance plans. Stores demographic and enrollment information for individuals covered under HMO, PPO, EPO, or POS plans.
  fields:
    - name: createdAt
      type: Timestamptz!
      description: Timestamp when the member record was created in the system.
    - name: dob
      type: Date!
      description: Date of birth. Used for age calculations, eligibility verification, and benefits determination.
    - name: firstName
      type: String_1!
      description: Member's first name as it appears on insurance card.
    - name: id
      type: Uuid!
      description: Unique identifier for the member. Primary key used for all member relationships (claims, appointments, prescriptions).
    - name: lastName
      type: String_1!
      description: Member's last name as it appears on insurance card.
    - name: plan
      type: String_1!
      description: Insurance plan type. Valid values - HMO (requires PCP, referrals needed), PPO (flexible network, no referrals), EPO (network only), POS (hybrid HMO/PPO).
    - name: updatedAt
      type: Timestamptz!
      description: Timestamp of the last update to this member record.
